# Buildaze Brand

## Business
- **Name:** Buildaze
- **Tagline:** Design, Development & Digital Growth Agency
- **Audience:** Businesses needing design, development, AI, digital marketing, and Shopify growth
- **Goal:** Clear scope, practical handover, optional ongoing support; convert visitors to project enquiries
- **Live URL:** https://www.buildaze.com
- **Local:** `npm run dev` → http://localhost:3000
- **Tone:** Practical, specific, confident; English; no invented stats/testimonials/clients
- **Logo:** `/public/Logo/` (`buildaze-logo-footer.svg`, `buildaze-logo-horizontal.svg`, `logo-1.svg`, favicon)

## Stack
Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS 4, Framer Motion, Three.js/R3F, Lenis. No component UI library. Custom SVGs for icons (lucide-react allowed when a consistent set is needed).

## Palette (do not invent new brand hues)
| Token | Value | Role |
|-------|-------|------|
| Primary / ink | `#0a0a0a` | Page canvas (dark), text on light |
| Ink elevated | `#0e0e10` | Elevated dark surfaces |
| Ink-3 | `#131316` | Dark tertiary |
| Accent / blue | `#2563eb` | Primary action |
| Accent hover | `#1d4ed8` | Hover / pressed blue |
| Accent soft | `#7fa6f5` | Readable blue text on dark |
| Accent dim | `rgba(37,99,235,0.14)` | Soft blue fill |
| Paper / white | `#ffffff` | Type on dark; light page bg |
| Soft | `#F7F8FA` | Light section bg |
| Blue soft | `#eff5ff` | Light blue wash |
| Text secondary (light) | `#475569` | Body on light |
| Text muted (light) | `#5c6678` | Captions on light (AA on soft) |
| Border light | `#e2e8f0` / hover `#cbd5e1` | Light borders |
| Mist (dark) | `rgba(255,255,255,0.6)` / `0.48` | Secondary / muted on dark (AA) |
| Line (dark) | `rgba(255,255,255,0.09)` / `0.16` | Borders on dark |

Only tints/shades derived from this palette. Source of truth: `app/themes/buildaze.css` + `app/globals.css` `@theme`.

## Typography
- **Sans / UI:** Space Grotesk (`--font-space-grotesk`) — headings + body
- **Mono / labels:** Geist Mono (`--font-geist-mono`) — technical labels (`.t-label`)
- Scale tokens: `--text-display`, `--text-h2`, `--text-h3`, `--text-lead`, `--text-body`, `--text-ui`, `--text-label`

## Radius / spacing / elevation
- Control: `12px` (`--radius-control`)
- Card / panel: `14px` (`--radius-card`, `--radius-panel`)
- Buttons/CTAs: capsule (`--radius-pill` / `.rounded-pill`; `rounded-full` still OK)
- Shadows: `--shadow-cta`, `--shadow-cta-light`, `--shadow-panel`, `--shadow-nav`, `--shadow-nav-light`
- Prefer existing Tailwind spacing rhythm; keep section padding consistent with current patterns
- Extra type tokens: `text-body-sm`, `text-ui-sm`, `text-caption` (migrate one-offs over time)

## Surfaces
Use theme classes: `.surface-ink`, `.surface-blue`, `.surface-page`, `.surface-soft`, `.surface-card` (and legacy `home-surface-*` aliases). Motif: `.build-grid` / `.build-grid-blue`.

## Hard constraints
1. Keep existing color scheme. No new brand colors. Only derived tints/shades as tokens.
2. Keep logo, fonts, tone, and copy meaning unchanged unless explicitly approved.
3. Do not break functionality, routes, forms, or SEO (meta, heading hierarchy, alt text).
4. Never invent facts, stats, testimonials, or client names. Flag copy that needs input.
5. No Figma tooling or suggestions.
6. Do-not-touch without approval: contact/form delivery, voice-agent API routes, CSP/security headers, SEO redirects in `next.config.ts`, factual content in `lib/data/` (structure OK; claims need approval).
